{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_durnar_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_durnar_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "額外訓練",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durnar_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e6ce0003084996be916501ae7eed2b83ff714f209580fc61d333a51a7a4c9bfc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "坚雷对A1小队的战斗测试"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "辛苦了，A1預備小隊的新人們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "今天的例行訓練內容，到這裡就——結束了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "恭喜恭喜！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "哎呀，原本你們剛來的時候練沒幾個小時就要死要活的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "看看現在，一個個還都還沒喘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "說明訓練效果還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嘿嘿，謝謝教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "米格魯！堅雷教官發言還沒結束，你怎麼可以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好啦芬，我又不是杜賓，沒那麼多規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "大家平時訓練都很累了，這種時候就輕鬆一點，可以吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你啊，越來越像杜賓了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！——是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你看啊，腰板一挺，手往兩旁一貼，視線直勾勾對著我眼睛，這不就是杜賓嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "語調嘛，這個就不用我說了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "真的哦，一模一樣~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "不過這也是件好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "和我當兵的時候不一樣，羅德島有個完整的教官團負責所有預備幹員的培訓，每個人都有他們的特點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "我想不到的，他們就會察覺到並給你們補上一課，反之也一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這樣一來，每個預備幹員都能獲得接近全面的訓練課程，而不是讓個傻大兵來想所有事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "格瑞斯、法倫、杜賓，還有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "無論是處理教學課程還是一起上戰場，都是些值得信任的好夥計啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "加油把杜賓身上的東西都學過來好嗎，我們還挺想多一個助教的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "好的教官，謝謝教官關心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "還有，提醒我訓練完以後找管理場地的人修整場地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好幾次都練忘了，結果回頭就被杜賓罵，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "明白了嗎，芬，一定要提醒我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是，教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "閒聊就到此為止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "全體都有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "立——正！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "正如大家所知的那樣，今天的例行訓練內容結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "但我們的訓練時間還空出了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "所以，在接下來的時間裡，我將和大家一起進行愉快的對抗訓練！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（倒吸一口涼氣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "唉？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "鑑於有幾位朋友還沒參與過對抗訓練的課程，所以呢，我會簡單講一下訓練內容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "（完了，死定了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "雖然聽上去挺花哨，但其實就是模擬實戰訓練，我會評估大家的作戰方式，然後給出優化方案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（小聲）姐姐，你看看米格魯啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（小聲）別說話，先聽教官講完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "啊當然，這次和普通的對抗還是有區別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "嗯——既然你們都在，那就當一對五的訓練賽吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "正好也讓我檢查一下各位的訓練成果和默契程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好，大家先休息一會，放放鬆，吃塊糖什麼的，我也去做個準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "解散！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "芬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "怎麼辦！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我，我不知道啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你們太緊張啦，又不是杜賓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "堅雷教官是不可怕啊，但，但格鬥對抗訓練時候的她完全是另外一回事啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "堅雷教官會參加近衛、重裝和先鋒幹員的近身對抗練習，這炎熔你是知道的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是啊，然後呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "你知道那時候堅雷教官是怎麼樣的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "還能......怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "她會放下盾牌提著兩把劍暴錘我一個小時的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "唰唰唰像風一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊，是這樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我以前一直以為教官天天都很和善，不怎麼批評人，還會請大家吃好吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "第一次格鬥對抗訓練結束以後才知道......堅雷教官要是開罵了比杜賓教官還狠。幾輪打下來，槍都有點拿不穩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "特別是持盾的那隻手，一旦拿了劍，揮下來真的像閃電那麼快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "啊，我知道了，大概就是和流星姐姐在訓練場裡對射那種感覺嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗚哇，和流星......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你可真行啊克洛絲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嘿嘿，沒過一分鐘就中了五支訓練箭啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好菜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "總之，如果不想挨打，千萬，千萬不可以小瞧堅雷教官啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "她可是個老兵，要不是對哥倫比亞軍方有意見，現在還是在役士兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "如果她一會多帶把刀來，我們就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "芙蓉，我問問啊，今天早上有人因為外傷去醫療部擦藥水的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "每天來醫療部的人都特別多，擦傷淤青之類其實還，挺常見的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "芙蓉，這個很重要，幫忙想一想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "今天早上我在給病房裡的人換藥，沒有去坐診。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "但是聽蘇蘇洛說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好像A4預備小隊所有人早上訓練結束後都去了一下外科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，是堅雷教官帶著去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "這有什麼聯繫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "沒想到玫蘭莎和卡緹也沒能擋住教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "就算教官能一個人對付你們，但我們有五個人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "A4也有五個人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那、那有什麼，我們還是比A4要強的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "對吧，芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊，啊啊，是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我們加油......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "加油！加油......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你們好像沒什麼信心嘛，真有這麼可怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "全體都有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "列隊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "嗯，看來你們都準備好了，很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "教官，能問個問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（克洛絲！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "問吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "您為什麼，多帶了把訓練劍啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "看你這問題問的，當然是為了訓練。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "哎呀，剛剛休息的時候突然懷念起以前的戰鬥技巧，想找人試試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "啊當然，我和大家用的東西一樣，是訓練用裝備，沒帶自己改裝的電刃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你們最好重視點啊，別因為平時對你們和善就覺得實踐也會讓你們一手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "不想挨打，就好好應戰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "訓練手冊上對於突發應敵的步驟之前有看過嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "第一次對抗我會面對你們開始，之後就要把整個場地利用起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
