      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "都起來吧，我來整理一下問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "炎熔，我們本來有機會的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不好意思啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "但我怎麼知道米格魯會突然擋住我嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這就是問題，對嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是，是的教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（好凶！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "確實，現在地形上沒有高低起伏，後排更容易產生誤傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "而且炎熔的源石技藝特性在這樣的空間裡施展不開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是，是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "在這種情況下，你完全可以把技藝施展到我背後，壓縮我的活動空間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "在我和你的隊友幾乎面對面的情況下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "為什麼瞄準我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "米格魯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "（要挨駡了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "“那個問題”，還沒能克服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "比以前穩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "但是，還不夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "卡緹防禦的時候特別喜歡晃動，雖然這樣會產生更多破綻，但這招對她是不管用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "我知道你的作戰風格是求穩，但在還沒能穩到抵抗干擾的時候，就要用技巧去補足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "舉盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "舉盾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "還記得我剛剛是怎麼干擾你的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "您格擋我的攻擊，然後撞在盾上，我就被帶到炎熔的源石技藝運行軌跡上去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "如果芬的行動夠快，她完全可以在我撞上你之前把我逼退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "就像第一次克洛絲做的那樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "但如果你準備一個人接下我的撞擊，你可以試試三種解決方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "一，想好反擊手段，然後閃開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這會讓你的隊友在某個瞬間完全暴露在敵人面前，但只要你能伺機擊倒我，就可以快速回到防禦姿態。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "二，直接架盾衝撞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "盾也是一種武器，在面對衝撞時，你也可以透過盾牌展開進攻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "只是，你需要時刻注意對方，別人沒撞到，自己一個踉蹌衝出去，把後背和隊友留給敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "三，偏轉方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你之所以會被我撞到炎熔的法術前，完全是因為你的姿態和重心讓我有這樣的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "如果你的防禦姿勢是這樣的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "還是後退了，但沒有影響到炎熔和克洛絲的攻擊路徑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "那就好，先學會這套方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "好的教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你是小隊的隊長，負責指揮大家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "告訴我，你怎麼確認隊友情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "靠感覺和觀察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "觀察？怎麼觀察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "用，用眼睛看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "在你回頭瞥一眼的瞬間，你覺得敵人會不會抓住這個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你們小隊的站位是根據基礎課程教材來的嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是的教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "但，不是太嚴格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "戰場條件那麼複雜，嚴格執行才會出錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "芙蓉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "在，教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你需要承擔芬的部分職責，可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "但我具體要做些什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你需要成為芬背後的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "如果你、炎熔和克洛絲的站位發生較大改變，需要告知芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "周邊環境的變化，特別是後方變動，你需要立刻告訴她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "在芬倒下的時候，你需要負責領導隊伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好的教官，我試試看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "克洛絲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我錯了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我不該射芙蓉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "遠程幹員的專業和分工我不太懂，就不評價了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "單論團隊配合，你做得還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "謝謝~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你方便說一下自己在射擊對抗訓練上的表現嗎，我好做個預估。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "一般是流星姐姐來當老師，唰唰唰就把我射倒了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛斯，別太隨便了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "流星——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好，好，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好了，都給我打起精神來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這才過了幾分鐘啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "接下來我們要用上訓練場的障礙物了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "這裡就是戰場，而戰場上的敵人可不會對你們手下留情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "希望你們，或者我，能在這裡多活幾秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "互相加油吧，小朋友們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "哎呀，看來我沒怎麼退步，真是太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "嗯——時間正好，那我們今天的訓練就正式結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "恭喜恭喜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "怎麼不拍手了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "對......對不起教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好啦，一會請你們吃好吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "臘腸怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "我那裡剛剛到了些炎國的臘腸，用特製醬料醃過，又鮮又香，可誘人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊，聽上去就很好吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "會不會太油膩了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "但在那之前，我得帶你們先去一趟醫療部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "你們放心，我也安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "原來卡緹她們不是被教官打進醫療部的啊，嚇死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "那當然不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "當了那麼多年兵，別的不說，對付你們幾個還是有法子的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "輕重緩急，早就拿捏好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "但是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "交給你們的技巧，可都是實打實拿傷口和戰友的命換回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "要是給我發現你們哪個不好好把訣竅記腦子裡，下一次我就拿電刃和你們練。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "明白了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "明，明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "好，那就出發吧，早檢查完早吃東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（我好像忘了件事......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（教官要我做什麼來著？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "芬，酸辣的吃嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "吃，吃啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "那一會的零食啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "好，謝謝教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "text": "都下課了，還在喊教官啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "不好意思，堅雷小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "你來的正好，訓練場是你在管理吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "是，是的，杜賓教官，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "堅雷帶的小組使用完訓練場地以後一些設施和障礙物有損毀，估計是剛剛進行了高強度對抗訓練。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "請幫我修整一下，晚上我帶預備幹員要用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "好，我這就去辦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "多謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
